 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They were all together in one place when Pentecost had come",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Waiting for the promise as the Lord had told them, every one",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a sound came from heaven like a rushing, violent wind",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And tongues as of fire came down and rested on each of them",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will pour out my Spirit on all flesh",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your sons and your daughters will prophesy",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your young men will see visions",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your old men will dream dreams",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From every nation under heaven came a crowd to hear the sound",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one heard them in his own language, and amazement spread around",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some mocked them, full of new wine, but Peter stood up with the eleven",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And raised his voice to tell them of the promise sent from heaven",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "This is what was spoken through the prophet Joel",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.42,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
